{"ticker":"APD","updated":"2026-11-13T22:38:37Z","profile":{"longName":"Air Products and Chemicals, Inc.","shortName":"Air Products and Chemicals, Inc","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"United States","website":"https://www.airproducts.com","fullTimeEmployees":null,"marketCap":70486654976,"trailingPE":132.43933,"forwardPE":20.363642,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.4258485,"pegRatio":2.25,"targetMeanPrice":343.7143,"targetHighPrice":375.0,"targetLowPrice":275.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.123,"earningsGrowth":130.118,"grossMargins":0.31584,"operatingMargins":0.24320999,"profitMargins":0.040960003,"totalRevenue":12990900224,"beta":0.669,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":324.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":229.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.29},"summary":"Air Products and Chemicals, Inc. provides atmospheric gases, process and specialty gases, equipment, and related services in the Americas, Asia, Europe, the Middle East, India, and internationally. The company produces atmospheric gases, including oxygen, nitrogen, and argon; process gases, such as hydrogen, helium, carbon dioxide, carbon monoxide, and syngas; and specialty gases for customers in various industries, including refining, chemical, metals, manufacturing, electronics, energy production, medical, food, chemical and petrochemical manufacturing, oil and gas recovery and processing, and steel and primary metals processing. It also designs and manufactures equipment for air separation, hydrocarbon recovery and purification, natural gas liquefaction, and liquid helium and liquid hydrogen transport and storage. Air Products and Chemicals, Inc. was founded in 1940 and is headquartered in Allentown, Pennsylvania.","summary_zh":"空氣化學產品公司在美洲、亞洲、歐洲、中東、印度和國際上提供大氣氣體、製程氣體和特殊氣體、設備及相關服務。該公司生產大氣氣體，包括氧氣、氮氣和氬氣；製程氣體，例如氫氣、氦氣、二氧化碳、一氧化碳和合成氣；為各行業的客戶提供特殊氣體，包括煉油、化工、金屬、製造、電子、能源生產、醫療、食品、化學和石化製造、石油和天然氣回收和加工、以及鋼鐵和初級金屬加工。它還設計和製造空氣分離、碳氫化合